[00:00.00] 作曲 : Johannes Eckerström/John Alfredsson/Johan Jarlsby/Henrik Sandelin/Simon Andersson/Markus Tagaris/Magnus Lundbäck
[00:00.00][by:重力失控]
[00:36.29]You feel a sudden pain
[00:36.29]疼痛骤然而至
[00:38.09]The night turns bright as day
[00:38.09]黑夜亮过白昼
[00:40.26]This **** is going straight
[00:40.26]尖啸轰鸣
[00:42.39]Out of your mind
[00:42.39]冲出思想
[00:44.60]You start to feel afraid
[00:44.60]试着感受恐惧
[00:46.42]It is the price you pay
[00:46.42]这是你的代价
[00:48.49]To get the thrill
[00:48.49]欲得战栗
[00:49.48]You need to stay alive
[00:49.48]必先生存
[01:00.27]Let it burn!
[01:00.27]燃烧殆尽吧！
[01:09.72]Between the cuts and cries
[01:09.72]穿过伤口与哭喊
[01:11.39]You'll find a way to die
[01:11.39]死亡之路展于眼前
[01:13.37]Just take a sip
[01:13.37]就来一点吧
[01:15.65]And twist it like a knife
[01:15.65]然后像捅进利刃一样 旋转
[01:17.78]A city full of sound
[01:17.78]光怪陆离 声色犬马
[01:19.81]Too late to turn around
[01:19.81]转身 然而太晚
[01:21.87]You need to flee the light
[01:21.87]只有驱散光芒
[01:23.95]To save your life
[01:23.95]那是你最后的机会
[01:26.70]You like when it hurts?
[01:26.70]你爱上这痛苦了没有？
[01:29.43]Let it burn!
[01:29.43]烧光吧！
[01:37.67]Let it burn!
[01:37.67]燃尽吧！
[01:46.95]You ain't sure what came first
[01:46.95]不知谁先袭来
[01:49.09]Was it your flame or thirst?
[01:49.09]是烈焰，还是干渴？
[01:51.21]You need to please them both
[01:51.21]你得同时取悦
[01:53.13]To put you out
[01:53.13]换取喘息之机
[01:55.41]Another wasted youth
[01:55.41]又一段空掷的迷茫
[01:57.28]You thought you'd seen the truth
[01:57.28]以为自己触摸到了真实
[01:59.42]You need to find a voice
[01:59.42]找个声音吧
[02:01.53]To help you shout
[02:01.53]让它为你咆哮
[02:04.33]I like when it hurts!
[02:04.33]我爱这伤痛！
[02:07.02]Let it burn!
[02:07.02]让它燃烧
[02:51.02]Let it burn!
[02:51.02]让它焚毁
[02:55.03]Let it burn!
[02:55.03]让它成为焦土！
[02:59.22]Let it burn!
[02:59.22]置于火海
[03:09.58]Let it burn!
[03:09.58]传来哔剥声响
[03:14.27]Let it burn!
[03:14.27]烈焰吞噬
[03:17.97]Let it burn!
[03:17.97]透出浓烟火光
[03:23.66]I like when it hurts!
[03:23.66]我是如此热爱这份痛苦！
[03:26.28]Let it burn!
[03:26.28]让一切燃烧殆尽！
